{"id":"hueso","lemma":"hueso","pos":"noun","rank":1453,"glosses":["bone","stone, pit (the central part of some fruits, consisting of the seed and a hard endocarp layer (like those of peach, olive, avocado or mango))","political position (appointed or elected)"],"ipa":"/ˈw̝eso/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"huesos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3c/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Rodelar-hueso.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Alguna vez te has roto un hueso?","en":"Have you ever broken a bone?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/330803","words":[null,null,{"g":"you"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"broken"},{"g":"a"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"ever"]]},{"text":"Puedo sentirlo en mis huesos.","en":"I can feel it in my bones.","words":[{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to feel","l":"sentir"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"my"},null]},{"text":"Ella es piel y hueso.","en":"She is all skin and bone.","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"skin"},{"g":"and"},null]},{"text":"No veo ningún hueso roto.","en":"I don't see any broken bones.","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to see, to spot","l":"ver"},null,null,{"g":"broken"}]},{"text":"A menudo, los perros entierran huesos.","en":"Dogs often bury bones.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/40260","words":[null,null,{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"dog","l":"perro"},{"g":"to bury","l":"enterrar"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"often, oftentimes"]]}]}